{"id":"bdef52f3ff411531","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-normal-modal-logic.md","title":"Normal Modal Logic","display":"df-normal-modal-logic — Normal Modal Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","aliases":["89-df-normal-modal-logic"],"display":"df-normal-modal-logic — Normal Modal Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","[[89-df-substitution-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-normal-modal-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-normal-modal-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-modal-logic — Normal Modal Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\">\\(\\mathrm K\\)</span> 为最小正规模态逻辑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 可数无限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> 为已有结构替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 是下文定义的一元公式集谓词，不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 已经满足它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm K\\subseteq L\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in L\\land(A\\to B)\\in L)\\to B\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A\\in L\\;(\\Box A\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A\\in L\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A[p:=B]\\in L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm K\\subseteq L\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in L\\land(A\\to B)\\in L)\\to B\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A\\in L\\;(\\Box A\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall A\\in L\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A[p:=B]\\in L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4–6；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>完整保留前轮加入的替换闭包与 MP、必然化条款；本次校正出处并显式声明字母载体。正规性不蕴含一致性：全公式集也是正规逻辑；典范模型定理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span> 是独立条件。\n单字母结构替换闭包等价于原书的同时统一替换闭包。对一条公式的有限原字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span>，选彼此互异的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span>，使它们既不在原公式也不在所有替换目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\">\\(B_i\\)</span> 中；先逐个把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span>，再逐个把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\">\\(B_i\\)</span>。新鲜性确保后一步不会修改先前插入的目标，结果正是同时替换。GL 的正规性由公理闭包与替换引理证明，不把本定义当成该结论本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm K\\subseteq L\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in L\\land(A\\to B)\\in L)\\to B\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\forall A\\in L\\;(\\Box A\\in L)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\forall A\\in L\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A[p:=B]\\in L).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"q_i","display":false},{"tex":"B_i","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"q_i","display":false},{"tex":"q_i","display":false},{"tex":"B_i","display":false}],"bytes":1809,"backlinks":[{"id":"b390be190f300538","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]])."},{"id":"42a3ef8675246492","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"568df5609e652c40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$, and $\\